<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43046" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">scŏpŭlōsus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj.
		scopulus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>full of rocks</i>, <i>rocky</i>, <i>shelvy</i>, <i>craggy</i> (rare but
			class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">locus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Div. in Caecil. 11, 35</span></i>
			:  mare, <i><span class="en">id. de Or.
				3, 19, 69</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">colles,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sil.
					7, 274</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rupes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Luc.
					2, 619</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Pylene,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Stat.
					Th. 4, 102</span></i>
			: cete, <i>projecting</i> like a rock,
					<i><span class="en">id. Achill. 1, 55</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">arva,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sil.
					15, 305</span></i>
			.—<i>Neutr. plur.</i> as <i>subst.</i>, <i>rocky places</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Gangem dejectum per scopulosa et abrupta,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					6, 18, 22, § 65</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">terga beluae,</span>”
				<i>projecting like rocks</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Val.
					Fl. 2, 518</span></i>
			.</div>
